# HSEQ Nova — UK product language

All user-facing text is **British English**. Do not leave Norwegian HMS copy in the app, emails, PDFs or toasts.

## Term map (use the UK column)

| Do not use | Use instead | Legal hook |
|---|---|---|
| HMS | HSEQ / health and safety | HSWA 1974 |
| HMS-håndbok | Health and safety policy | HSWA s.2(3) |
| Avvik | Incident / accident book entry | Accident book; RIDDOR 2013 |
| Nestenulykke | Near miss | Accident book (not RIDDOR) |
| Ulykke / skade | Accident / injury | RIDDOR |
| Farlig situasjon | Unsafe condition / dangerous occurrence | RIDDOR if listed |
| Vernerunde | Workplace inspection | MHSWR 1999 |
| Verneombud | Safety representative | SRSCWR 1977 |
| Stoffkartotek | COSHH register / COSHH assessment | COSHH 2002 |
| SJA | RAMS (risk assessment and method statement) | MHSWR; CDM 2015 |
| SHA / Byggherreforskriften | CDM 2015 | CDM 2015 |
| Digital HMS-tavle | Digital safety board | CDM site information |
| Rutine | Procedure / arrangement | HSWA s.2 organisation + arrangements |
| Tiltak | Action | MHSWR |
| Årsplan HMS | Annual H&S plan | MHSWR |
| Varsling | Whistleblowing | PIDA 1998 |
| Arbeidstilsynet | HSE | — |
| Organisasjonskart | Organisation chart | HSWA s.2(3) |
| Ledelsens gjennomgang | Management review | ISO 45001 |
| Brannøvelse | Fire drill | Fire Safety Order 2005 |
| Opplæring | Training / competence | HSWA s.2(2)(c) |
| HMS-ansvarlig | HSE manager / competent person | MHSWR reg.7 |
| Ansatt | Employee | — |
| Leder | Line manager / supervisor | — |
| Bedriftshelsetjeneste / BHT | Occupational health | — |

## Spelling

Organisation, colour, programme, defence. Never "HMS Nova" in the product.

## Do not change

Route paths (`/dashboard/hms-handbok`, `/rutiner`), Prisma enum values (`AVVIK`, `VERNEOMBUD`), or database column names. Change **labels only**.
